        "minutes": 4,
        "cells": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Press Start exercise below to start the mic and the band: Dm7, G7, then two bars of Cmaj7. Sing the guide tones on \"ah\": {{4}} over Dm7, {{4}} over G7, {{3}} over Cmaj7. Then put a turn on each one as its chord arrives, up to the note above and down to the note below, before you hold it.\nTry the other line too: {{1}}, {{7}}, {{7}}."
          },
